		<name>FreeCell</name>
		<summary>The Windows XP FreeCell, with the original deal numbers</summary>
		<desc>A FreeCell clone that plays like the Windows XP original. Select Game numbers
1 to 1000000 use the Microsoft FreeCell deal algorithm, so a numbered game
deals the same cards as it did on Windows. New Game deals a random shuffle.

Features: undo, hints, statistics, a saved game that resumes where you left
off, and the winning card cascade. No ads, no tracking and no network access.</desc>
